          "text": "Verification starts with the document itself: it must include business context, technical ownership, a visual flow, data or configuration tables, customization guidance, common mistakes, and validation evidence. Developers then run the documentation generator and content-pack validator so the page becomes backend-owned data with checksum, lifecycle, navigation, access policy, publication state, and search metadata."
